WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.062
The tests.

2
00:00:01.062 --> 00:00:05.999
Six new offline tests cover the six
outcomes, the grace period expiring,

3
00:00:05.999 --> 00:00:10.601
the guard never calling the reader,
a missing saved read as an error,

4
00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:13.362
a null read as not
found, and the refusals.

5
00:00:13.362 --> 00:00:16.725
The kit's original nine
re-read tests still pass.

6
00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:20.193
And the business rule's six
Node tests pin its behavior:

7
00:00:20.193 --> 00:00:25.203
a person's close is redirected, only the
verifier with fresh evidence may close,

8
00:00:25.203 --> 00:00:29.982
either one alone isn't enough, the
exception approver may cancel with a note,

9
00:00:29.982 --> 00:00:33.980
and on incidents only the
integration's tickets are governed.
